+    raise KleanPreflightError(
+tools.klean_preflight.KleanPreflightError: lake clean failed (1): error: could not detect the configuration of the Lake installation
+
+DIAGNOSIS
+Lean 4.22 calls readlink("/proc/<getpid()>/exe"). The audit sandbox denies
+that link, although /proc/self/exe is readable. This was confirmed by the
+launcher error, disassembly of lean_io_app_path, and a direct readlink probe.
+The rerun used the narrowly scoped LD_PRELOAD shim whose source is
+/tmp/audit-work/lean_app_path_shim.c. It substitutes Linux AT_EXECFN only for
+that exact denied readlink request and delegates all other readlink calls.
